'''Sunfire splinters''' can be obtained from participating in the [[Fortis Colosseum]], hunting [[sunlight antelope]], defeating [[the Hueycoatl]] and opening [[Chest (moon key)]]. They are used for various items:
{{List|c=1|
* Charging [[Dizana's quiver]] and the [[Tonalztics of Ralos]] as well as blessing Dizana's quiver to make it permanently charged
* Creating [[sunfire rune]]s with [[rune essence]] (and variants) alongside [[fire rune]]s (1 fire rune and 1 sunfire splinter are used per essence) and by extension making [[searing page]]s
* Creating [[Jug of sunfire wine|jugs of sunfire wine]] from a [[jug of wine]] (uses 2 splinters per jug, requires [[Pestle and mortar|pestle & mortar]])
}}
Dizana's quivers can be exchanged for 4,000 sunfire splinters by talking to [[Minimus]]. The average number of Sunfire splinters gained per successful Colosseum run is {{Formatexpr
|{{Decimals|(1/1*80)+(1/7*150)+(9/70*150)+(1/70*500)+(5535/43400*150)+(615/43400*500)+(2725/19250*500)+(2375/16800*500)+(5832/45920*500)+(756/45920*1100)+(14472/114240*500)+(1876/114240*1750)+(3180/21600*1100)+(424/21600*2500)+(2340/16000*1750)+(312/16000*3500)+(360/2080*2500)+(792/4800*3500)|2}}}}, not including exchanging the additional quivers from completion.

